@startuml Planificar ruta
actor Usuario
participant "RoutesRestController" as RoutesController
participant "RouteService" as RouteService
participant "MapboxService" as MapboxService
participant "AlertService" as AlertService
participant "RouteRepository" as RouteRepository
participant "API Mapbox" as MapboxAPI
participant "API OpenWeather" as OpenWeatherAPI
database "BBDD Zonas Inundables" as FloodDB
database "BBDD App" as AppDB

== Planificar ruta ==
Usuario -> RoutesController : POST /api/v1/routes/calculate (RouteRequestDTO, JWT)
RoutesController -> RouteService : calculateRoute(request, idUsuario)

'## Geocodificar direcciones
RouteService -> MapboxService : geocodificar(direccion)
MapboxService -> MapboxAPI : Request Geocoding API
MapboxAPI --> MapboxService : CoordinateDTO (lat, lng)
MapboxService --> RouteService : CoordinateDTO origen/destino

'##  Obtener rutas desde Mapbox
RouteService -> MapboxService : calcularRutasAlternativas(origen, destino)
MapboxService -> MapboxAPI : Request Directions API
MapboxAPI --> MapboxService : List<RouteMapboxDTO> (lineString, distancia, duración)
MapboxService --> RouteService : List<RouteMapboxDTO>

'## Verificar riesgo inundación + clima (checkFloodRiskWithWeather)
RouteService -> FloodDB : Consulta espacial nativa (intersección lineString)
FloodDB --> RouteService : Zonas inundables
RouteService -> AlertService : obtenerAlertaMeteo(lat, lng)
AlertService -> OpenWeatherAPI : Request Weather API
OpenWeatherAPI --> AlertService : Datos meteorológicos
AlertService --> RouteService : AlertDTO (riesgo por zona)

'## Guardar ruta en historial (saveRoute)
RouteService -> RouteRepository : save(route)
RouteRepository -> AppDB : INSERT Route
AppDB --> RouteRepository : OK
RouteRepository --> RouteService : Route guardada

'## Obtener alerta clima destino
RouteService -> AlertService : obtenerAlertaMeteo(lat, lng)
AlertService -> OpenWeatherAPI : Request Weather API
OpenWeatherAPI --> AlertService : Datos meteorológicos
AlertService --> RouteService : AlertDTO destino

'## Respuesta
RouteService --> RoutesController : RouteResponseDTO
RoutesController --> Usuario : 200 OK (ruta, distancia, duración, alertas, rutaAlternativa)

@enduml